{"id":"haya","lemma":"haya","pos":"noun","rank":285,"glosses":["beech, beech tree"],"ipa":"/ˈaʝa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"hayas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/47/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-haya.wav","examples":[{"text":"No puedes aceptar que haya ganado yo, ¿verdad?","en":"You just can't accept that I won, can you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1155993","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to accept"},{"g":"that"},null,{"g":"livestock, cattle"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"truth"}]},{"text":"Me gusta que no haya nadie alrededor.","en":"I like that there's no one around.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/422552","words":[null,null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"no / not"},null,{"g":"no one"},{"g":"around"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"like, thumbs up"]]},{"text":"Puede que él lo haya visto.","en":"He may have seen it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/568417","words":[null,null,{"g":"he"},{"g":"it / him"},null,{"g":"seen"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"it may be that"]]},{"text":"Espero que haya suerte.","en":"I hope it goes well.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/298922","words":[{"g":"to hope","l":"esperar"},{"g":"that"},null,{"g":"luck, fortune"}]},{"text":"Confío en que haya éxito.","en":"I hope it goes well.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/298923","words":[{"g":"to reassure","l":"confiar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"that"},null,{"g":"success"}]}]}